java.net.ServerSocket: Listens for incoming TCP connections on the server machine.

java.net.Socket: Represents an individual active TCP network connection (used by both client and server).

java.io.BufferedReader & InputStreamReader: Reads character streams efficiently from the socket's input stream.

java.io.PrintWriter: Writes text output back out through the socket's output stream easily.

java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService & Executors: Manages a thread pool so multiple clients can connect concurrently.

java.util.Scanner: Captures user text typed directly into the command-line console.